segments.text:
On the twenty-second day of the month of May, in the year one thousand nine hundred and six, at the Sergeant's School of Arms (EsSA), witness, * fen Cav LUIS HENRIQUE AMORIM, Id n° 025452413-5 MinEx, son of ANTONIO DOMINGO S DE AMORIM and MARIA OSVALDA RAMOS DE AMORIM, residing at Rua Presidente Dutra n° 50-D-Centro, in this city, was asked if he could attest to the work routine of 1st Lt Inf MARCIO LUIZ PASSOS TIBERIO, to which he responded yes;

that on the twenty-second day of January, Monday, 1st Lt TIBERIO arrived at the Sergeant's School of Arms at 07:00 hours, the quarter where he works, exercising the function of Chief of the 3rd Sec of the BCSv and Commander of the Police Platoon of the Army (Pel PE) for the morning formation of the BCSv, commanding the Pel PE, then performing tasks in the 3rd Sec of the BCSv until approximately 11:15 hours;

that immediately after, he went for lunch at the officers' casino, returning at 13:15 hours for the afternoon formation with the Pel PE;

that from the beginning until 16:00 hours, he was performing tasks in the 3rd Sec of the BCSv;

that from this moment, he conducted military physical training until approximately 17:15 hours;

that immediately after, he went to... for his home; who on January 23, 1996, Tuesday, attended EsSA for the morning graduation, and also performed work; in the 3rd Sector of BCSv, achieving at the School; at 1:15 p.m. also participated in the afternoon graduation with BCSy, performing work in the same sector until 4:00 p.m. at 7:30 a.m. he went to his home. Asked if he knows or has had contact with Mr. Ubirajara Rodrigues and Vittorio Pacaccini? Answer: ... he knows these people.
        And as he said nothing more and was not asked, the official in charge of this
syndicate declared this interview concluded, which, after being read and found
accurate, is duly signed by this interviewing officer and the witness.

